DESCRIPTION:Sankofa 365 is a social gathering that honors the spirit of pla
 y and joy in diasporic communities. As such\, the events give students an 
 uplifting beginning and end to their semesters as they build and establish
  connections within the Wolfpack community.
GEO:35.785108;-78.674529
LOCATION:Witherspoon Student Center\, 355
SUMMARY:Sankofa 365
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/sakofa-365
CATEGORIES:Community Events
CATEGORIES:Student Life
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:NC State African American Cultural Center
DTSTAMP:20260804T033344Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53496617230677
DTSTART:20260827T160000Z
DTEND:20260827T173000Z
DESCRIPTION:Do you want to make the most of your first year at NC State? If
  so\, join the African American Cultural Center (AACC) for an EQUIP intere
 st meeting to learn how this year-long program can help you build the coll
 ege experience you actually want — both inside and outside the classroom
 .\n\nWhat is EQUIP? EQUIP stands for Empower\, Question\, Understand\, Ini
 tiate and Partner. Designed specifically for first-year students\, EQUIP s
 upports you in cultivating self-awareness\, community and resilience. As a
 n EQUIP participant\, you’ll get:\n\nOne-on-one guidance at monthly chec
 k-ins with dedicated staff and support from an embedded AACC counselorSkil
 l-building opportunities at interactive learning labs focused on self-awar
 eness\, resilience and navigating campus resourcesAccess to AACC signature
  events\, wellness activities\, and EQUIP special programming to help buil
 d your networkStop by an interest meeting to learn how to unlock your full
  potential at NC State. Contact Andaiye Qaasim\, assistant director of the
  AACC\, at aaqaasim@ncsu.edu if you have questions.\n\nRegistration is req
 uired.
GEO:35.785108;-78.674529
LOCATION:Witherspoon Student Center\, African American Cultural Center (Sec
 ond-Floor Library)
SUMMARY:EQUIP Interest Meetings
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/equip-interest-meeting
CATEGORIES:Student Life
CATEGORIES:Information Session
CATEGORIES:High-Impact Experiences
END:VEVENT
