DESCRIPTION:Join the African American Cultural Center for its Black History
  Month and Futures Month kickoff event. Our Black History Month theme for 
 the 2027 academic year centers on our 55th anniversary: Legacy\, Libations
  and Liberation. Stop by our table in the lobby of Talley Student Union to
  enjoy refreshments\, engage in an interactive activity and learn about ou
 r calendar of Black History and Futures Month events.
GEO:35.784114;-78.671321
LOCATION:Talley Student Union\, Second-Floor Lobby
SUMMARY:Black History and Futures Month Kickoff at Talley
