DESCRIPTION:Join the African American Cultural Center for the launch of its
  2027 Black History and Futures Month celebration.  Come kick back with us
 \, get a first look at our Black History and Futures Month events calendar
  and meet our student leaders and staff. We'll have games\, interactive tr
 ivia and tons of prizes and giveaways to celebrate Black History and Futur
 es Month and the center's 55th anniversary in style.
GEO:35.785108;-78.674529
LOCATION:Witherspoon Student Center\, African American Cultural Center\, Ro
 om 356 and Living Room Space
SUMMARY:Black History and Futures Month Kickoff at Witherspoon
