UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53488232010268
DTSTART:20270225T230000Z
DTEND:20270226T020000Z
DESCRIPTION:To wrap up Black History and Futures Month\, the African Americ
 an Cultural Center (AACC) will open its doors for a night dedicated to leg
 acy and community. We’re celebrating 55 years of the AACC with an evenin
 g packed with high-energy games\, food and refreshments\, music and the be
 st company on campus. Pull up with your friends\, connect and help us clos
 e out the month in style. Come ready to laugh\, unwind and toast to our 55
 -year legacy.
GEO:35.785108;-78.674529
LOCATION:Witherspoon Student Center\, African American Cultural Center 
SUMMARY:Black History and Futures Month Closing Celebration
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.ncsu.edu/event/black-history-and-futures-mon
 th-closing-celebration
CATEGORIES:Student Life
END:VEVENT
